"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">지원대상</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"center\" width=\"550\" height=\"31\"><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">＊종합설계 교과목을 수강하는 학부(과) 3,4학년 재학생</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"center\" width=\"75\" height=\"72\"><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">지원방법</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"center\" width=\"550\" height=\"72\"><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 10.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -10.9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">＊기업체 대상 기술수요 조사를 바탕으로 본교 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\">3,4학년 재학생을 대상으로 팀을 구성하여 기업</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">기반 캡스톤디자인 설계 및 제작</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">＊최소 2인 이상 최대 5인 이하로 팀 구성</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid\" valign=\"center\" width=\"75\" height=\"98\"><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">지원내용</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid\" valign=\"center\" width=\"550\" height=\"98\"><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">＊기업기반 캡스톤디자인 과제 수행을 위한 물품</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\"> 구매, 출장비, 회의비 지원</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\"><!--StartFragment--></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 11.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -11.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">(단, 출장비 및 회의비는 총 지원 금액의 각각10% 이내 지원)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 11.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -11.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\">＊기업기반 캡스톤디자인 신청금액은 <span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">팀별 최대 2,500,000원 지원</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 11.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -11.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">＊그린에너지 분야 20팀</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '나눔고딕'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt\">&nbsp;※ LINC사업 사업관리지침에 따라 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #800000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '나눔고딕'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt\">출장비 및 회의비 지원은 변경될 수 있음</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '나눔고딕'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: '나눔고딕'\">3. 신청서류</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: '나눔고딕'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;1) 기업기반 캡스톤디자인 기술수요조사서</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; LETTER-SPACING: -1.8pt\"> 1부</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: '나눔고딕'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;2) 기업기반 캡스톤디자인 신청서 및 계획서</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; LETTER-SPACING: -1.8pt\"> 1부</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: '나눔고딕'\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: '나눔고딕'\">4. 제출기간 : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: '나눔고딕'\">2012. 5. 9(수)까지</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: '나눔고딕'\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: '나눔고딕'\">5. 제출처 : 각 학부(과) 종합학사행정실</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: '나눔고딕'\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: '나눔고딕'\">6. 추진 일정</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><sp